partment concerned to the Government of Assam.\nLearn More\n~ ~ Notice Board ~ ~\nOfficial\nNotices & Updates\nLatest general notifications, examination notices, and tender updates from the college.\nGeneral Notification\nExam Notification\nTender Notification\nScooter Public Notice-Portal Opening\nNEW\nPublished Date: 31/07/2026\n1st MERIT LIST FOR ADMISSION INTO B.A. 1ST SEMESTER (FYUGP), 2026\nNEW\nPublished Date: 02/06/2026\nSati Sadhani Divas (Notice)\nNEW\nPublished Date: 20/04/2026\nRongali Bihu (Notice)\nNEW\nPublished Date: 11/04/2026\n2nd , 4th and 6th Semester Examination Notice\nNEW\nPublished Date: 11/04/2026\nEmpowering Students For a Better Tomorrow\nAdmissions Open 2026\nJoin Government Model College, Kaziranga and explore a wide range of academic and skill-based programs. We focus on excellence in education, practical learning, and overall development to help you achieve your career goals.\nClick to View All Notification\nInsight Stands Out\nShare your hunger, heart and harmony.\nWe believe in four pillars of influence that drive our growth. This is ingrained in everything we do We use technology to create a better and smarter environment.\nClick to View All Examination Notification\nIndulge your curiosity.\nAn award-winning company.\nWe believe in four pillars of influence that drive our growth. This is ingrained in everything we do We use technology to create a better and smarter environment.\nClick to view All Tender Notice\nCollege Events~\nOur Latest\nEvents\nMay 5, 2026\nBihu Celebration 11/04/2026\nMay 5, 2026\nBook Inauguration Programme 25/02/2025\nMay 5, 2026\nAwareness Programme on Solid Waste Management 30/03/2026\nMay 5, 2026\nSkill Development Workshop 17/03/2026\nClick To View All Events\nUseful Links\ne-samadhan\nSaathi Portal\nGovernment Model College, Kaziranga which has been initiated by the Government of Assam as a premier institution was established at Kaziranga,\nAbout us\nQuick Links\nIGNOU\nUniversity Grant Commission\nGettin